OL,3,GNEWSA'We're worried about noise, lights
OL,4,Aand traffic' - concerns over new
OL,5,Afootball training centre
OL,6,
OL,7,FCampaigners trying to stop a national
OL,8,Ffootball training centre being built
OL,9,Fnear Ballymena are worried about the
OL,10,Fimpact of floodlights and more traffic
OL,11,Fin a rural area.
OL,13,FThey have also raised concerns that
OL,14,Fnoise from the pitches would scare
OL,15,Fhorses.
OL,17,FThe state-of-the-art facility due to be
OL,18,Fbuilt by the Irish Football Association
OL,19,F(IFA) by 2028.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
